  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peer to peer support to Supreme Audit Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The objective of the assignment is to provide the contracting authority, INTOSAI and donor-partners with an overview and analysis of peer-to-peer support to supreme audit institutions. The analysis should provide information on this instrument, its strengths and weaknesses so that &#xbf;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the P2P landscape&amp;nbsp;and its different models of support can be better understood&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;good practices that could be shared and solutions could be identified for the &#xbf;bottlenecks&#xbf; to encourage more efficient P2P&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;funding and funding modalities of P2P support can improve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
